cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below. Once the accompanying manuscript is published, please cite that paper instead/in addition — see README.md."
type: software
title: "C2K-GRO: Coupled Cotton2K-GroIMP Cotton Growth Model — Source Code and Data"
abstract: >-
  Daily bidirectional coupling of the process-based crop model Cotton2K and the
  functional-structural plant modelling platform GroIMP, for simulating cotton
  (cv. Tahe-2) growth under film-mulched drip irrigation in the Alar reclamation
  area, southern Xinjiang, China. Includes source code, calibration/validation
  parameter files, daily weather forcing, and model outputs for two growing
  seasons (2022, 2025) used in bidirectional cross-validation.
